## 2. API Endpoints Contract

### 2.1 Lookup Endpoints (for Step 2 Dropdowns)
- **Nature of Membership:** `GET /api/v1/lookups/nature-of-memberships`
  - Items shape: `{ _id: string, title: string, key: 'REAL' | 'LEGAL' }`
- **Membership Types:** `GET /api/v1/lookups/membership-types`
  - Items shape: `{ _id: string, title: string, code: string }`
- **Specializations (Optional):** `GET /api/v1/lookups/specializations`
  - Items shape: `{ _id: string, title: string, code: string }`

### 2.2 Upload & Preview Endpoint
- **URL:** `POST /api/v1/members/import/preview`
- **Content-Type:** `multipart/form-data`
- **Payload:** `file: File` (Max 15MB)
- **Response Structure (`200 OK`):**
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Excel file uploaded and analyzed successfully",
    "data": {
      "fileId": "string (UUID)",
      "originalFilename": "string",
      "sheets": ["string"],
      "selectedSheet": "string",
      "totalRows": 150,
      "columns": [
        { "key": "A", "index": 0, "headerSample": "کد عضویت" },
        { "key": "B", "index": 1, "headerSample": "نام" }
      ],
      "previewRows": [
        { "rowNumber": 1, "A": "کد عضویت", "B": "نام" },
        { "rowNumber": 2, "A": "1001", "B": "علی" }
      ],
      "suggestedMapping": {
        "memberCode": "A",
        "firstName": "B",
        "lastName": "C",
        "nationalCode": "D",
        "membershipDate": "E",
        "expiryDate": "F",
        "mobilePhone": "G",
        "email": "H"
      }
    }
  }
  ```

### 2.3 Confirm & Import Endpoint
- **URL:** `POST /api/v1/members/import/confirm`
- **Content-Type:** `application/json`
- **Request Body:**
  ```json
  {
    "fileId": "string (UUID from preview)",
    "sheetName": "string (optional, defaults to first sheet)",
    "startRow": 2,
    "fixedData": {
      "natureOfMembership": "string (ObjectId, key, or title)",
      "membershipTypeId": "string (ObjectId, code, or title)",
      "specializationId": "string (optional ObjectId or code)",
      "status": "ACTIVE"
    },
    "columnMapping": {
      "memberCode": "A",
      "firstName": "B",
      "lastName": "C",
      "nationalCode": "D",
      "membershipDate": "E",
      "expiryDate": "F",
      "mobilePhone": "G",
      "email": "H"
    }
  }
  ```
- **Response Structure (`200 OK`):**
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Members import completed successfully",
    "data": {
      "summary": {
        "totalRows": 149,
        "processedCount": 149,
        "importedCount": 145,
        "skippedCount": 4
      },
      "failedRows": [
        {
          "rowNumber": 12,
          "memberCode": "1012",
          "nationalCode": "0012345678",
          "fullName": "علی محمدی",
          "reason": "کد ملی '0012345678' قبلاً در سامانه برای عضو دیگری ثبت شده است"
        }
      ],
      "importedMembers": [
        {
          "id": "67104ac79f821a0012345678",
          "memberCode": "1001",
          "fullName": "علی محمدی"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
  ```

